 "description": "Olsen2003_neutrophil_oscillatory_metabolism\nBioModels BIOMD0000000143 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000143_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 100000 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000143_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: still changing at cap), sampling 100.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:5:10:0 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS (Kintecus within 0.0332% of the SBML; run on James's PC in 310 s)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] 'H_p' goes below zero in the SBML: integrated as H_p_o = value + 500000, output as H_p = OUTC[H_p_o;-500000*source]\n  [info] 'H_c' goes below zero in the SBML: integrated as H_c_o = value + 5000000, output as H_c = OUTC[H_c_o;-5000000*source]\n  [info] R19 term 1/2 (volume 10): rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] R19 term 2/2 (volume 10): rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] R19 (volume 1): rate not proportional to its reactants; written once as signed lines (source+S[USER;...]) for O2_p",
